#: data/maps/LilycoveCity_LilycoveMuseum_1F/scripts.inc:161
msgctxt "LilycoveCity_LilycoveMuseum_1F_Text_WelcomeToLilycoveMuseum"
msgid ""
"Welcome to LILYCOVE MUSEUM.\p"
"Please take the time to enjoy our\n"
"collection of fantastic artwork\l"
"featuring POKéMON.$"
msgstr ""
"欢迎来到水静美术馆。\p"
"请慢慢欣赏我们收藏的\n"
"以宝可梦为主题的精彩艺术品。$"

#: data/maps/LilycoveCity_LilycoveMuseum_1F/scripts.inc:167
msgctxt "LilycoveCity_LilycoveMuseum_1F_Text_ImCuratorHaveYouViewedOurPaintings"
msgid ""
"I'm the CURATOR of this MUSEUM of\n"
"fine arts.\p"
"It's heartening to see someone so\n"
"young as you in our MUSEUM.\p"
"Have you viewed our collection of\n"
"paintings already?$"
msgstr ""
"我是这座美术馆的馆长。\p"
"看到像你这么年轻的人\n"
"来我们美术馆，真让人欣慰。\p"
"你已经看过我们收藏的\n"
"画作了吗？$"

#: data/maps/LilycoveCity_LilycoveMuseum_1F/scripts.inc:175
msgctxt "LilycoveCity_LilycoveMuseum_1F_Text_NotDisturbYouTakeYourTime"
msgid ""
"Ah, then let me not disturb you.\n"
"Please, do take your time.$"
msgstr ""
"啊，那我就不打扰你了。\n"
"请慢慢欣赏吧。$"

#: data/maps/LilycoveCity_LilycoveMuseum_1F/scripts.inc:179
msgctxt "LilycoveCity_LilycoveMuseum_1F_Text_HaveYouAnInterestInPaintings"
msgid ""
"Oh? I do believe that you seem to\n"
"be a POKéMON TRAINER.\p"
"Have you an interest in paintings,\n"
"too?$"
msgstr ""
"哦？我想你应该是\n"
"一位宝可梦训练家吧。\p"
"你对绘画也有兴趣吗？$"

#: data/maps/LilycoveCity_LilycoveMuseum_1F/scripts.inc:185
msgctxt "LilycoveCity_LilycoveMuseum_1F_Text_HonoredYoudVisitInSpiteOfThat"
msgid ""
"I see…\p"
"I'm honored that you would visit\n"
"us in spite of that.$"
msgstr ""
"原来如此……\p"
"即便如此你还是来参观了，\n"
"我感到很荣幸。$"

#: data/maps/LilycoveCity_LilycoveMuseum_1F/scripts.inc:190
msgctxt "LilycoveCity_LilycoveMuseum_1F_Text_ExcellentCanYouComeWithMe"
msgid ""
"Ah, excellent!\n"
"You do like paintings!\p"
"Then, may I ask you to come with me?$"
msgstr ""
"啊，太好了！\n"
"你果然喜欢绘画！\p"
"那么，能请你跟我来一下吗？$"

#: data/maps/LilycoveCity_LilycoveMuseum_1F/scripts.inc:195
msgctxt "LilycoveCity_LilycoveMuseum_1F_Text_VeryOldPainting"
msgid ""
"It's a very old painting.\n"
"The paint is peeling here and there.$"
msgstr ""
"这是一幅非常古老的画。\n"
"颜料到处都剥落了。$"

#: data/maps/LilycoveCity_LilycoveMuseum_1F/scripts.inc:199
msgctxt "LilycoveCity_LilycoveMuseum_1F_Text_OddLandscapeFantasticScenery"
msgid ""
"It's an odd landscape with bizarre\n"
"and fantastic scenery.$"
msgstr ""
"这是一幅描绘了奇异梦幻景色的\n"
"不可思议的风景画。$"

#: data/maps/LilycoveCity_LilycoveMuseum_1F/scripts.inc:203
msgctxt "LilycoveCity_LilycoveMuseum_1F_Text_PaintingOfBeautifulWoman"
msgid ""
"It's a painting of a beautiful, smiling\n"
"woman with a POKéMON on her lap.$"
msgstr ""
"这幅画描绘了一位美丽的女性，\n"
"她面带微笑，膝上抱着宝可梦。$"

#: data/maps/LilycoveCity_LilycoveMuseum_1F/scripts.inc:207
msgctxt "LilycoveCity_LilycoveMuseum_1F_Text_PaintingOfLegendaryPokemon"
msgid ""
"It's a painting of a legendary POKéMON\n"
"from long ago.\p"
"The artist painted this from\n"
"imagination.$"
msgstr ""
"这幅画描绘的是\n"
"很久以前的传说中的宝可梦。\p"
"画家是凭想象画出来的。$"

#: data/maps/LilycoveCity_LilycoveMuseum_1F/scripts.inc:213
msgctxt "LilycoveCity_LilycoveMuseum_1F_Text_PaintingOfGrassPokemon"
msgid ""
"It's a painting of GRASS POKéMON\n"
"swaying in a breeze.\p"
"They appear to be enjoying the wind's\n"
"gentle caress.$"
msgstr ""
"这幅画描绘了在微风中\n"
"摇曳的草宝可梦。\p"
"它们似乎正在享受\n"
"微风温柔的抚摸。$"

#: data/maps/LilycoveCity_LilycoveMuseum_1F/scripts.inc:219
msgctxt "LilycoveCity_LilycoveMuseum_1F_Text_PaintingOfBerries"
msgid ""
"It's a delicious-looking painting\n"
"of BERRIES.\p"
"This painting could make you hungry!$"
msgstr ""
"这是一幅看起来很好吃的\n"
"树果画。\p"
"看着这幅画都会让人肚子饿！$"

#: data/maps/LilycoveCity_LilycoveMuseum_1F/scripts.inc:224
msgctxt "LilycoveCity_LilycoveMuseum_Text_BirdPokemonSculptureReplica"
msgid ""
"It's a replica of a famous sculpture.\p"
"It depicts an ancient BIRD POKéMON.$"
msgstr ""
"这是一座著名雕塑的复制品。\p"
"它刻画的是一只古代的鸟宝可梦。$"

#: data/maps/LilycoveCity_LilycoveMuseum_1F/scripts.inc:228
msgctxt "LilycoveCity_LilycoveMuseum_1F_Text_BigPokeBallCarvedFromStone"
msgid ""
"It's a big POKé BALL carved from\n"
"a black stone.\p"
"It was apparently used in festivals\n"
"in the olden days.$"
msgstr ""
"这是一个用黑色石头\n"
"雕刻而成的大精灵球。\p"
"据说以前是在祭典上使用的。$"

#: data/maps/LilycoveCity_LilycoveMuseum_1F/scripts.inc:234
msgctxt "LilycoveCity_LilycoveMuseum_1F_Text_StoneTabletWithAncientText"
msgid ""
"It's a huge stone tablet inscribed\n"
"with POKéMON and dense text in the\l"
"small characters of an ancient,\l"
"unreadable language.$"
msgstr ""
"这是一块巨大的石板，\n"
"上面刻着宝可梦，\l"
"还有密密麻麻的小字，\l"
"是一种无法解读的古代文字。$"

#: data/maps/LilycoveCity_LilycoveMuseum_1F/scripts.inc:240
msgctxt "LilycoveCity_LilycoveMuseum_1F_Text_WorksOfMagnificence"
msgid ""
"Hmmm…\n"
"What works of great magnificence…$"
msgstr ""
"嗯……\n"
"真是些宏伟壮丽的作品啊……$"

#: data/maps/LilycoveCity_LilycoveMuseum_1F/scripts.inc:244
msgctxt "LilycoveCity_LilycoveMuseum_1F_Text_MustntForgetLoveForFineArts"
msgid ""
"Battling with POKéMON is fun,\n"
"I'll grant you that.\p"
"But one mustn't forget our love for\n"
"the fine arts.$"
msgstr ""
"和宝可梦一起对战很有趣，\n"
"这一点我承认。\p"
"但是，我们也不能忘记\n"
"对美术的热爱。$"

#: data/maps/LilycoveCity_LilycoveMuseum_1F/scripts.inc:250
msgctxt "LilycoveCity_LilycoveMuseum_1F_Text_ThisMuseumIsInspiration"
msgid ""
"This ART MUSEUM… Well, you could\n"
"see many fantastic paintings.\p"
"And the CURATOR is a wonderful person.\p"
"Among artists like myself, this MUSEUM\n"
"is an inspiration.$"
msgstr ""
"这座美术馆……嗯，\n"
"能看到很多精彩的画作。\p"
"而且馆长也是个很棒的人。\p"
"对我们这些画家来说，\n"
"这座美术馆是灵感的源泉。$"

#: data/maps/LilycoveCity_LilycoveMuseum_1F/scripts.inc:257
msgctxt "LilycoveCity_LilycoveMuseum_1F_Text_ThisLadyIsPretty"
msgid ""
"This lady is pretty!\n"
"She's like Mommy!$"
msgstr ""
"这位阿姨好漂亮！\n"
"就像妈妈一样！$"

#: data/maps/LilycoveCity_LilycoveMuseum_1F/scripts.inc:261
msgctxt "LilycoveCity_LilycoveMuseum_1F_Text_ThisPokemonIsAdorable"
msgid ""
"This POKéMON is adorable!\n"
"Just like our little boy!$"
msgstr ""
"这只宝可梦好可爱！\n"
"就像我们家的儿子一样！$"

#: data/maps/LilycoveCity_LilycoveMuseum_1F/scripts.inc:265
msgctxt "LilycoveCity_LilycoveMuseum_1F_Text_HeardMuseumGotNewPaintings"
msgid ""
"I'd heard that this ART MUSEUM got\n"
"in some new paintings.\p"
"So, naturally I hurried over.\p"
"Are the new paintings up on\n"
"the second floor?$"
msgstr ""
"我听说这座美术馆\n"
"来了一些新的画作。\p"
"所以我当然就赶紧过来了。\p"
"新的画作是在二楼吗？$"

#: data/maps/LilycoveCity_LilycoveMuseum_1F/scripts.inc:272
msgctxt "LilycoveCity_LilycoveMuseum_1F_Text_CuratorHasBeenCheerful"
msgid ""
"Lately, the CURATOR has been\n"
"unusually cheerful.\p"
"I bet something good happened for him.\n"
"Definitely.$"
msgstr ""
"最近馆长的心情\n"
"格外好。\p"
"他一定是遇到什么好事了。\n"
"肯定是。$"

#: data/maps/LilycoveCity_LilycoveMuseum_1F/scripts.inc:278
msgctxt "LilycoveCity_LilycoveMuseum_1F_Text_AimToSeeGreatPaintings"
msgid ""
"I aim to see many great paintings\n"
"here and learn from them.\p"
"I have this dream of one day having\n"
"my artwork exhibited here.$"
msgstr ""
"我想在这里看很多优秀的画作，\n"
"并从中学习。\p"
"我梦想着有一天，\n"
"我的作品也能在这里展出。$"

#: data/maps/LilycoveCity_LilycoveMuseum_1F/scripts.inc:284
msgctxt "LilycoveCity_LilycoveMuseum_1F_Text_MuseumTouristDestination"
msgid ""
"The ART MUSEUM has become a favorite\n"
"tourist destination.\p"
"It's great for LILYCOVE…\n"
"No, great for the HOENN region!\p"
"This is what I've heard--a lone TRAINER\n"
"procured all the paintings upstairs.$"
msgstr ""
"美术馆已经成了\n"
"很受欢迎的旅游景点。\p"
"这对水静市……不，\n"
"对整个丰缘地区都是好事！\p"
"我听说——楼上所有的画，\n"
"都是一位训练家独自收集来的。$"
